 = gyan\u00fat kelt (pl. His strange behavior began to _______ suspicion among his colleagues.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ the imagination = felkelti a k\u00e9pzeletet (pl. The mysterious old house continued to _______ the imagination of the children.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a reaction = reakci\u00f3t v\u00e1lt ki (pl. The controversial statement was sure to _______ a strong reaction from the public.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>excite<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>exciting<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>excitedly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>excitement<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>excite<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: excite interest \/ excite suspicion \/ excite the imagination \/ excite a reaction<\/span><\/p><p>similar: arouse \/ stimulate \/ provoke \/ thrill<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: calm \/ soothe \/ bore<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"excite","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09","due_at":"2026-06-09T10:15:42+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-09T10:15:03+00:00"},{"id":51430,"front":"<p>Excuse me, could you tell me where the nearest _______ is? <em>(mosd\u00f3 \/ WC)<\/em><\/p><p>The airplane&#039;s _______ was temporarily out of order during the flight. <em>(rep\u00fcl\u0151g\u00e9p mosd\u00f3ja \/ fed\u00e9lzeti WC)<\/em><\/p><p>Guests are kindly requested to keep the communal _______ clean and tidy. <em>(k\u00f6z\u00f6s mell\u00e9khelyis\u00e9g \/ k\u00f6z\u00f6s illemhely)<\/em><\/p><p>