. <em>(illat \/ szag)<\/em><\/p><p>The chemical spill produced a pungent _______ that quickly spread through the building. <em>(er\u0151s szag \/ kellemetlen szag)<\/em><\/p><p>Detecting the subtle _______ of decay, the forensic team knew they were close to the source. <em>(boml\u00e1s szaga \/ rothad\u00e1s szaga)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite the fresh paint, a lingering _______ of smoke still permeated the old apartment. <em>(f\u00fcstszag \/ megmaradt szag)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">szag \/ illat \/ b\u0171z<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): illattalan \/ szagtalan \/ illatmentes<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 faint _______ = gyenge szag\/illat (pl. A faint _______ of lavender filled the room.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 strong _______ = er\u0151s szag\/illat (pl. There was a strong _______ of garlic in the kitchen.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 unpleasant _______ = kellemetlen szag (pl. The drains emitted an unpleasant _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 distinct _______ = jellegzetes szag (pl. The wine had a distinct _______ of oak.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 lingering _______ = tart\u00f3s\/megmaradt szag (pl. A lingering _______ of perfume remained after she left.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>odour<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>odorous<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>odour<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: faint odour \/ strong odour \/ unpleasant odour \/ distinct odour<\/span><\/p><p>similar: smell \/ aroma \/ fragrance \/ scent<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: freshness \/ cleanliness \/ purity<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"odour","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026