nt<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>excite<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: excite interest \/ excite suspicion \/ excite the imagination \/ excite a reaction<\/span><\/p><p>similar: arouse \/ stimulate \/ provoke \/ thrill<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: calm \/ soothe \/ bore<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"excite","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09","due_at":"2026-06-09T10:15:03+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-09T10:15:42+00:00"},{"id":51434,"front":"<p>After realizing she left her keys at the cafe, she had to _______ her steps all the way back. <em>(visszamegy \/ visszak\u00f6vet)<\/em><\/p><p>Detectives often have to _______ a suspect&#039;s movements to build a timeline of events. <em>(nyomon k\u00f6vet \/ felder\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>To understand the current economic crisis, we must _______ the historical factors that led to it. <em>(visszavezet \/ elemzi az el\u0151zm\u00e9nyeket)<\/em><\/p><p>The author decided to _______ her journey through the remote mountains in her latest memoir. <em>(\u00fajra bej\u00e1r \/ le\u00edrja az \u00fatj\u00e1t)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">visszamegy \/ visszak\u00f6vet \/ \u00fajra bej\u00e1r<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): el\u0151rehalad \/ folytatja \/ tov\u00e1bbmegy<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ one&#039;s steps = visszamegy a nyom\u00e1n (pl. He had to _______ his steps to find his lost wallet.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a path = \u00fajra bej\u00e1r egy utat (pl. They decided to _______ the path of their ancestors.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a journey = \u00fajra bej\u00e1r egy utaz\u00e1st (pl. The documentary will _______ the journey of the explorers.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the events = visszak\u00f6veti az esem\u00e9nyeket (pl. Police are trying to _______ the events leading up to the accident.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>retrace<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>retrace<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: retrace one&#039;s steps \/ retrace a path \/ retrace a journey \/ retrace events<\/span><\/p><p>similar: go back over \/ track back \/ revisit \/ review<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: advance \/ proceed \/ continue<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"retrace","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09","due_at":"2026-06-09T10:18:45+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-09T10:05:46+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-09T13:11:04+00:00"},{"id":51435,"front":"<p>The news of the sudden factory closure caused considerable _______ among the employees. <em>(nyugtalans\u00e1got \/ aggodalmat)<\/em><\/p><p>A sense of _______ settled over the village after the mysterious disappearance. <em>(nyugtalans\u00e1g \/ zavarts\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>His unusual silence began to _______ his parents, who were used to his constant chatter. <em>(nyugtalan\u00edtani \/ aggasztani)<\/em><\/p><p>The government&#039;s new policy on education has created widespread _______ in academic circles. <em>(el\u00e9gedetlens\u00e9get \/ aggodalmat)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">nyugtalans\u00e1g \/ aggodalom \/ zavar \/ nyugtalan\u00edt \/ aggaszt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nyugalom \/ b\u00e9ke \/ megnyugv\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 cause _______ = nyugtalans\u00e1got okoz (pl. The rumors caused widespread _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a sense of _______ = egyfajta nyugtalans\u00e1g (pl. A sense of _______ pervaded the room.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 feel _______ = nyugtalans\u00e1got \u00e9rez (pl. She began to feel _______ about the delay.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 considerable _______ = jelent\u0151s nyugtalans\u00e1g (pl. There was considerable _______ over the decision.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>disquiet<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>disquieting<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>disquietingly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>disquiet<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>disquiet<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: public disquiet \/ growing disquiet \/ deep disquiet \/ social disquiet<\/span><\/p><p>similar: unease \/ anxiety \/ apprehension \/ worry<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: calm \/ peace \/ tranquility<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"disquiet\ndisquieting\ndisquietingly","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-09","due_at":"2026-06-09T10:19:00+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-09T10:06:37+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_